                "MAE in EUR on held-out listings only: the Paris and Lyon test split, and Bordeaux (city C). v1 = week-1 model, scored on Bordeaux unchanged. v2 = week-2 model, where *calibrated* uses Bordeaux's median price from its training split and *uncalibrated* uses no Bordeaux prices at all. Baseline = median price of the same room type and guest count in Paris+Lyon training data.\n"
